# Trail Color Controller
entities.FollowerAddons/TrailColorController.placements.name.normal=Trail Color Controller
entities.FollowerAddons/TrailColorController.placements.description.normal=Allows mappers to add custom trail colors to non-Vanilla entities.\nCan be global or room specific.

entities.FollowerAddons/TrailColorController.attributes.name.color=Trail Color
entities.FollowerAddons/TrailColorController.attributes.description.entities=A semicolon (;) separated list of entities to apply this trail color to.\nRequires a Follower / Holdable Trail Trigger to be used. Case sensitive.

# Entity Outliner
entities.FollowerAddons/EntityOutliner.placements.name.normal=Entity Outliner
entities.FollowerAddons/EntityOutliner.placements.description.normal=Allows mappers to add a tinted outline to any entity with a sprite component.\nCan be global or room specific.

entities.FollowerAddons/EntityOutliner.attributes.name.color=Outline Color
entities.FollowerAddons/EntityOutliner.attributes.description.entities=A semicolon (;) separated list of entities to apply this outline to. Case sensitive.
entities.FollowerAddons/EntityOutliner.attributes.description.offset=The distance the outline will have from the entity's sprite.

